     2249   define variable varroad-tax        like ub.price-list.road-tax   no-undo.
     2250   define variable varexcise          like ub.price-list.excise     no-undo.
     2251   do on error undo, return error return-value :
     2252   for each bf_tt-allsum-line
     2253   on error undo, return error return-value
     2254    :
